OL,3,GNEWSABoy's care package decided after
OL,4,Ahospital failure
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrimley Health NHS Trust admitted
OL,7,Fnegligence and that his treatment fell
OL,8,Fbelow a reasonable standard in 2021. It
OL,9,Fsaid had he been cared for at the
OL,10,Fhospital rather than discharged, he
OL,11,Fwould not have suffered the brain
OL,12,Finjury.
OL,14,FA judge decided the boy, who cannot be
OL,15,Fnamed for legal reasons, will live in a
OL,16,Fneuro-rehabilitation unit which can
OL,17,Fmeet his needs.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
